WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.612
Some aromatic pollutants barely dissolve in water.

00:00:03.612 --> 00:00:06.424
The project asked whether a polymer could

00:00:06.424 --> 00:00:09.236
give those molecules somewhere else to go.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.163
At a research meeting in 2017, we

00:00:19.163 --> 00:00:22.526
presented the theoretical and experimental study. The

00:00:22.526 --> 00:00:25.888
poster records that question, not an unrestricted

00:00:25.888 --> 00:00:27.810
claim of environmental cleanup.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.959
A diblock copolymer contains segments that respond

00:00:33.959 --> 00:00:37.118
differently to water. That contrast can make

00:00:37.118 --> 00:00:40.278
self-assembly favorable, but only under the right

00:00:40.278 --> 00:00:40.729
conditions.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:49.462
The proposed micelle places water-compatible segments outside

00:00:49.462 --> 00:00:53.124
and hydrophobic segments inward. Pollutant partitioning into

00:00:53.124 --> 00:00:56.786
a core is a hypothesis requiring measurement.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.534
Composition, concentration and mixing can change what

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:06.269
forms. A drawing of a neat micelle

00:01:06.269 --> 00:01:09.003
tells us nothing about what actually assembled

00:01:09.003 --> 00:01:10.175
in the vial.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.686
I kept this specimen photograph from the

00:01:18.686 --> 00:01:21.572
project period. It documents a material in

00:01:21.572 --> 00:01:24.458
my hand; its appearance alone cannot establish

00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:26.519
size, loading or removal efficiency.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.759
And there was this notebook: a series

00:01:33.759 --> 00:01:36.719
of unfortunate trials. The archive records the

00:01:36.719 --> 00:01:39.678
struggle, without proving which experimental procedure failed

00:01:39.678 --> 00:01:41.369
from the photograph alone.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.753
A research question can survive an unsuccessful

00:01:48.753 --> 00:01:51.705
attempt. The experiment still must answer whether

00:01:51.705 --> 00:01:54.658
the polymer assembled and whether the pollutant

00:01:54.658 --> 00:01:55.923
was actually recovered.
